[1mtack help[22m[2m · import add ·[22m[32m ✓ success[39m

Preview a remote location and copy chosen skills into a declared
skills folder of a source you own; --apply requires --into,
writes the folder and an imports record in the source's
tack.yaml, and delivers nothing until sync

  [2mUsage[22m  tack import add [flags] <location>
  [2mMode[22m   preview-apply

[1mArguments[22m
  <location>  A location that names its provider:
              github:org/repo[/folder][#ref], or an
              https://github.com/... URL or git@github.com:....
              Providers: github

[1mFlags[22m
  --into <string>   The registered source that receives the
                    skills, SOURCE or SOURCE:FOLDER; required
                    with --apply
  --skill <string>  Import this skill by name; repeat for
                    several
  --all             Import every importable skill in the
                    location
  --full-depth      Search every folder up to five levels deep
  --apply           Apply the planned changes

[1mRoot flags[22m
  --json                Print the version 1 JSON envelope; only
                        status, sync, doctor, upgrade and
                        version have a stable payload
  --state-dir <string>  Override the Tack state directory

[1mExamples[22m
  [36mtack import add github:anthropics/skills[39m
    [2mList what the location offers[22m
  [36mtack import add github:anthropics/skills --skill pdf --into[39m \
    [36mmy-skills[39m
    [2mPreview the copy and where it will be delivered[22m
  [36mtack import add github:anthropics/skills --skill pdf --into[39m \
    [36mmy-skills --apply[39m
  [36mtack import add github:anthropics/skills --all --into[39m \
    [36mmy-skills:vendor/skills --apply[39m
    [2mUse a named declared skills folder[22m
